@page "/"

<PageTitle>AmigoAlert - Emergency Contact Help</PageTitle>

<div class="mb-4">
    <h1 class="mb-1">AmigoAlert: Help for Emergency Contacts</h1>
    <p class="lead text-muted">Bookmark this page to refer back to it at any time.</p>
</div>

<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title h5">What is an emergency contact?</h3>
        <p class="card-text">AmigoAlert lets someone send an alert to the people they trust when they need help. If someone asked you to be their emergency contact, you will be notified when they send an alert.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title h5">How you are added</h3>
        <p class="card-text">You will receive a text message with a consent link. Open the link to review the terms, then choose <strong>Accept</strong> or <strong>Decline</strong>. You are only added as a contact if you accept.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title h5">What you will receive</h3>
        <p class="card-text">After you accept, you will receive text messages when the person who added you sends an alert. If they chose to share it, the message includes their location.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="alert alert-warning mb-3" role="alert">
    <h3 class="alert-heading h5">If you receive an alert</h3>
    <p class="mb-0">Try to contact the person right away. If you believe they are in danger, call your local emergency services.</p>
</div>

<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title h5">Stop receiving notifications</h3>
        <p class="card-text">Open the consent link from the original text message again and choose <strong>Withdraw consent</strong>. Notifications stop straight away, and you can accept again from the same link if you change your mind. You can also ask the person who added you to remove you as a contact. If you have not yet responded to the link, choose <strong>Decline</strong> and you will not receive notifications.</p>
    </div>
</div>
